{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game where you develop territory in a retro style. Start with a small plot of land and expand it into a thriving empire. Build profitable businesses, manage resources, and earn passive income over time. The game features a variety of landscapes, each with its own unique challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and addictive gameplay: click to open cells, construct buildings, and earn money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique terrain types: fields, swamps, forests, lakes, deserts, and mountains, each with its own characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economic strategy: decide where to build and what\u2019s most profitable for faster progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixel graphics and minimalist interface that enhance the nostalgic gaming experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149260?t=1764060460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149260?t=1764060460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149260/10cb355387f946c1b897fc11b7ee9da74a5639e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764060460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149260/10cb355387f946c1b897fc11b7ee9da74a5639e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764060460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An idle game where you develop territory in a retro style. Start with a small plot of land and expand it into a thriving empire. Build profitable businesses, manage resources, and earn passive income over time. The game features a variety of landscapes, 